{
  "format_version": 1,
  "_comment": [
    "The curated Tasks view (#7): four categories, each an ordered list of destinations.",
    "Data, not code, so a Hyprland release re-curates by editing JSON and a wrong page is a",
    "one-line diff rather than a patch. `hyprtweaker.ui.pages.tasks` is the reader.",
    "",
    "A destination is either an option Page -- `id`, `title`, and what it claims -- or an",
    "`entity` reference naming a Page the shell already builds (binds, the rule lists,",
    "Displays, and the seven declarative Pages of #70). Entities are referenced rather than",
    "described because their content comes from the model, not from the Schema.",
    "",
    "An option Page claims Options two ways. `sections` claims whole Sections: the Page is",
    "that Section's home, and every Option in it lands here unless a group pulls it away.",
    "`groups` claims named Options explicitly, under a heading the curator chose -- this is",
    "how `input` splits four ways and how `misc` dissolves, both of which the design canvas",
    "asks for. A key may be claimed by exactly one group across the whole file; the",
    "completeness test enforces that, so a copy-paste cannot silently duplicate a setting.",
    "",
    "Absent from this file on purpose: the hidden tier (`debug`, `quirks`, `experimental`,",
    "`input-capture`). ADR-0013 §5 makes it Config-view-only, so it has no Tasks home at any",
    "switch setting. The canvas's 19th page was an Advanced page holding exactly those; the",
    "ADR is later and wins, which is why there are 18 destinations of options here."
  ],
  "categories": [
    {
      "id": "look",
      "title": "Look",
      "pages": [
        {
          "id": "look.general",
          "title": "General",
          "sections": ["general"],
          "groups": [
            {
              "title": "Splash & wallpaper",
              "options": [
                "misc:disable_hyprland_logo",
                "misc:disable_splash_rendering",
                "misc:col.splash",
                "misc:splash_font_family",
                "misc:force_default_wallpaper",
                "misc:background_color",
                "misc:font_family"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "look.decoration",
          "title": "Decoration",
          "sections": ["decoration"]
        },
        {
          "id": "look.animations",
          "title": "Animations",
          "sections": ["animations"]
        },
        { "entity": "entity:animations" },
        { "entity": "entity:curves" },
        {
          "id": "look.layouts",
          "title": "Layouts",
          "sections": ["layout", "dwindle", "master", "scrolling"]
